WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.683
Open a project folder.

2
00:00:02.683 --> 00:00:04.403
Manual mode: every change and command asks first.

3
00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:09.741
Describe the problem in plain words.

4
00:00:09.741 --> 00:00:12.639
The agent reads the project inside an isolated sandbox.

5
00:00:12.639 --> 00:00:17.465
A command: it runs in the sandbox with no network, only after your yes.

6
00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:22.813
Approved once. The agent continues.

7
00:00:22.813 --> 00:00:27.399
A proposed edit: read the diff, then approve it once.

8
00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:28.727
Approved once. The agent continues.

9
00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:33.208
A command: it runs in the sandbox with no network, only after your yes.

10
00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:35.872
Approved once. The agent continues.

11
00:00:35.872 --> 00:00:44.794
Ask for the proof.

12
00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:49.638
A command: it runs in the sandbox with no network, only after your yes.

13
00:00:49.638 --> 00:00:50.467
Approved once. The agent continues.

14
00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.467
Tests pass. The edit and the test run each waited for a yes.

15
00:00:53.467 --> 00:01:07.067
The Changes panel shows exactly what changed on disk.
